---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Your HIPAA Readiness Checklist
permalink: /resources/hipaa-readiness-checklist/thank-you/
description: "Your HIPAA Readiness Checklist."
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
{%- from "partials/components.njk" import ctaBand -%}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Your checklist</span>
    <h1>HIPAA Readiness Checklist</h1>
    <p class="lead">For each item, ask whether you could produce evidence today, not whether it is generally done. An item you cannot document is worth flagging.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- for g in checklist %}
    <div class="margin-layout">
      <div class="margin-label"><span class="eyebrow">{{ loop.index }} of {{ checklist.length }}</span><h2>{{ g.area }}</h2></div>
      <ol class="readiness-list">
        {%- for it in g.items %}<li><span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><strong>{{ it[0] }}</strong>{% if it[1] %}<span>{{ it[1] }}</span>{% endif %}</div></li>{% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    <p class="disclaimer">This checklist is a general self-assessment aid. It is not a complete list of HIPAA requirements and is not legal advice.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{{ ctaBand("Several items you could not check off?", "A compliance review helps you prioritize which gaps to close first.") }}
